              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How much does a control terminal cost?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Innovorder offers subscription-based solutions. To find out the price of a kiosk, contact an Innovorder advisor and receive a customized quote based on your pizzeria's actual needs.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e86-bd72d42c" data-w-id="08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e86" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do I install a control terminal?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our experts take care of everything! In France or in the French overseas departments and territories, our team will come to your restaurant to install, configure and train you in the use of the terminal.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e91-bd72d42c" data-w-id="08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e91" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Why equip your pizzeria with a kiosk?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">It's no surprise that more and more pizzerias are equipping themselves with ordering kiosks. Saving time on a daily basis, boosting sales, advanced personalization, quick and easy checkout and even menu management based on stock levels are just some of the advantages of kiosks.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e9c-bd72d42c" data-w-id="08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e9c" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How does an order terminal work?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Equipped with a touch screen, printer and payment terminal, the order terminal allows your customers to enter their order and pay without the help of an employee. Via an order path specially designed for your pizzeria, customers browse the menu, select their pizza and pay by credit card, while the order is sent directly to the kitchen.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2ea7-bd72d42c" data-w-id="08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2ea7" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do you choose an order terminal for your pizzeria?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Many criteria come into play when choosing a kiosk: the layout of your establishment, the size of your store, your sales targets, your customer journey, your budget, the design and ergonomics you're looking for, and the level of personalization you need. The best thing is to talk it over with an expert who can help you make the right choice!<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
